### 环境变量配置 (IDEA 环境可以直接在顶部定义)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@adminToken = {{login.response.body.data.token}}
@paperId = {{createPaper.response.body.data}}

### 1. 管理员登录 (获取 Token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

### ------------------- 试卷管理 API 测试 -------------------

### 2. 试卷列表分页查询
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/paper/page?pageNo=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3. 手动创建试卷 (组卷)
# @name createPaper
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/paper/create
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "2026年度Java高级工程师晋升考核",
  "durationMins": 120,
  "passScore": 60,
  "questionList": [
    {
      "questionId": 1,
      "itemScore": 10,
      "sortNum": 1
    }
  ]
}

### 4. 发布试卷 (核心: 预热到 Redis)
# 注意：这一步要求试卷关联的题目在 exam_question 表中真实存在，否则会报错
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/paper/publish/{{paperId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ------------------- 考试流转 API 测试 (需先注册/模拟普通用户) -------------------

### 5. 获取试卷详情 (万人并发测试接口 - 直接读Redis)
GET {{baseUrl}}/exam/paper/detail/{{paperId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. 答题心跳保存
POST {{baseUrl}}/exam/session/heartbeat
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paperId": {{paperId}},
  "questionId": 1,
  "userAnswer": "B"
}

### 7. 提交试卷 (发送 MQ)
POST {{baseUrl}}/exam/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paperId": {{paperId}},
  "forceSubmit": false
}